<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-US">Dear researcher, welcome to the TRAIL. This is a
practical guide for navigating the world of transdisciplinary work and
learning. This tool helps you to understand, develop and implement
transdisciplinary education.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Transdisciplinary education serves as a bridge
between theory and practical application, between education, research, and
society. Explore how you can connect your research ambitions with
forward-thinking students and the world outside academia.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-US">Whether you are an experienced researcher or
just finding your way, the TRAIL is here to support you, regardless of your
background. Together, we can tackle real-world challenges and make a meaningful
impact.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

